            <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span id="alg1.l8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span><span id="alg1.l8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{next}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">next</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{next}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l8.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l8.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">in</span><span id="alg1.l8.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l8.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l8.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">do</span><span id="alg1.l8.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg1.l8.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Can alternatively consider the top-<math id="alg1.l8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> tokens only
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
