</span><span id="alg1.l9.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Base-model logits
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg1.l10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">      </span><math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\hat{s}\leftarrow\mathrm{decode}(\mathrm{prefix}\|\mathrm{next})\|\texttt{[TRUNC]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">decode</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">prefix</mi><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">next</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace" mathsize="0.900em">[TRUNC]</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{s}\leftarrow\mathrm{decode}(\mathrm{prefix}\|\mathrm{next})\|\texttt{[TRUNC]}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span><span id="alg1.l10.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Mark that <math id="alg1.l10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>s</mi><mo mathsize="1.110em">^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{s}</annotation></semantics></math> is unfinished
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
