            <span id="alg1.l11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">      </span><math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi\leftarrow\displaystyle\max_{s\in\mathcal{S}}\;E\bigl(\hat{s},\,s\bigr)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">π</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><munder><mi mathsize="0.900em">max</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒮</mi></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">E</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi\leftarrow\displaystyle\max_{s\in\mathcal{S}}\;E\bigl(\hat{s},\,s\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span><span id="alg1.l11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Similarity score with the most similar existing generation
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
              
              
