</span><span id="alg1.l12.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="alg1.l12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Repel toward semantic novelty
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
